secubox-toolbox (1.3.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add local_store.py mitmproxy addon : captures ALL flows directly into
    toolbox.db (events table) hashed with daily-rotating sel. Sources :
    dpi (request hooks), cookies (response hooks), soc (suspicious patterns),
    ja4 (TLS ClientHello). No dependency on external sockets (cookies/dpi/
    soc/threat-analyst .sock) which are Phase 2.
  * _aggregate_session : reads per-MAC events from SQLite + computes top DPI
    hosts, cookies stats, SOC indicators with risk_score, JA4 SNIs/ALPNs.
  * PDF report : new sections DPI top hosts, cookies trackers, SOC indicators,
    JA4 empreintes TLS.
  * HTML live report : same sections + tables, conditionally shown.
  * systemd unit : load local_store.py addon.
  * success.html : Statut session button now points to /report/me/html
    (live analysis page, auto-refresh 15s).

